{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103550","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103550","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710355001:0":{"text":"……是康拉德大法官吗？哦，还有……乌瑟斯子爵？","source_cn":"……是康拉德大法官吗？哦，还有……乌瑟斯子爵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC230110B63863EA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710355002:0":{"text":"公主殿下！艾雅保佑，能平安见到您真是荣幸之至。","source_cn":"公主殿下！艾雅保佑，能平安见到您真是荣幸之至。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEEDC4C1C6B84A2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710355003:0":{"text":"公主殿下，日安。","source_cn":"公主殿下，日安。<key:dialog5>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E2F07124F7E8E98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710355004:0":{"text":"既然您也出现在这里，那么老夫的推论就成立了——我们确实被困在圣古堂内部了。","source_cn":"既然您也出现在这里，那么老夫的推论就成立了——我们确实...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5D851419674F5D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710355005:0":{"text":"恕我直言，公主殿下。这件事发生得太过……巧合了。","source_cn":"恕我直言，公主殿下。这件事发生得太过……巧合了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44C0275C5FAFEBF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710355006:0":{"text":"大法官，您这是什么意思？","source_cn":"大法官，您这是什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9290EDBF76057AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710355007:0":{"text":"从逻辑上来看，变量往往就是原因。","source_cn":"从逻辑上来看，变量往往就是原因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B070BEA9E388E6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710355008:0":{"text":"奥利安王子祭拜后，仪式完美结束，没有任何异常。然而，轮到您的时候却发生了这种灾难。","source_cn":"奥利安王子祭拜后，仪式完美结束，没有任何异常。然而，轮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9E57AB6BCAB9488","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710355009:0":{"text":"身为大法官，我有责任核实每一个细节——今日的仪式中您的一举一动，是否严格遵守了规定？","source_cn":"身为大法官，我有责任核实每一个细节——今日的仪式中您的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1EDD450AE175372","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710355010:0":{"text":"您是否在无意中……触犯了某种禁忌，才招致了这种祸端？","source_cn":"您是否在无意中……触犯了某种禁忌，才招致了这种祸端？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x092B5AE0BFD81210","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710355011:0":{"text":"大法官阁下，您是在审问我吗？","source_cn":"大法官阁下，您是在审问我吗？","